# TICKER: goes on in the background (tools/mkvbs.py makes TICKER.VBS
# and TICKER.BIN). The stage counts the seconds in A and a ball crosses
# the screen; behind other programs both go on, unseen, so when it comes
# back to the front it has counted the time it was away.
BEHIND RUN
BG 0

SPRITE 0 100 8 8 6

START STAGE
FOREVER
  PRINT A 16 30
  WAIT 50
  CHANGE A 1
END

START SPRITE:1
SPEED 1 0
FOREVER
  MOVE
  BOUNCE
END
